+/// Move the world origin to newOrigin in one pass: every body position, shape bounding box,
+/// broad-phase proxy and cached contact query box becomes relative to newOrigin, so
+/// position -= newOrigin. Joints, contact manifolds and warm starting impulses are relative to
+/// the bodies and carry over unchanged. Bodies keep their velocities and no body is woken, so a
+/// resting or sleeping island stays as it is. Body move and contact hit events of the last step
+/// are shifted as well. Use this to keep the simulation near the origin in a large world.
+/// Not allowed while the world is locked. A non-finite origin is ignored.
+B3_API void b3World_ShiftOrigin( b3WorldId worldId, b3Pos newOrigin );
+
 /// Set the gravity vector for the entire world. Box3D has no concept of an up direction and this
 /// is left as a decision for the application. Usually in m/s^2.
